{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/3adc571d03e542b9cbea9d7980e2899c.avif?t=1756895885\" width=940 height=184 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/b6decf2c521e17972518211a0ddf3adf.poster.avif?t=1756895885\" width=780 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/b6decf2c521e17972518211a0ddf3adf.webm?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/b6decf2c521e17972518211a0ddf3adf.mp4?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Elemental Fusion Formations to Unleash Powerful Attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental forces are interconnected and can transform into one another. To land the strongest blow, you\u2019ll need to coordinate your main attacker with allies of different elements to form an Elemental Fusion Formation. The rarer and smarter your combo, the greater power it unleashes!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/cf6557288334b4e4a7f856dcdd23b94e.avif?t=1756895885\" width=940 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/418c9a5d7389526fffcfcbd6bcecac15.poster.avif?t=1756895885\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/418c9a5d7389526fffcfcbd6bcecac15.webm?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/418c9a5d7389526fffcfcbd6bcecac15.mp4?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuse Shroom Knights to Evolve and Unlock Powerful Skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine two shroom warriors of the same level and element to evolve them into a higher-tier guardian. With each promotion, your knight gains a new skill. Even the tiniest shroomling can one day grow into a mighty hero!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/82287db78b2b62093594225a61e8d6e6.avif?t=1756895885\" width=940 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/e7e422de0f100c28fbf88de1bbd794f6.poster.avif?t=1756895885\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/e7e422de0f100c28fbf88de1bbd794f6.webm?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015030/extras/e7e422de0f100c28fbf88de1bbd794f6.mp4?t=1756895885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edit Genes to Create Superheroes or the Perfect Team</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During evolution, you decide how the genetic chains (skills) of the two base units are inherited. With careful choices and smart combinations, you can craft a truly unique shroo